<title>JAPAN: Tokyo rubber futures market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo rubber futures market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo rubber futures market is closed for a national holiday on Monday. Trading will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, rubber futures ended lower across the board, with the spot December contract expiring sharply lower on heavy long liquidation. Benchmark May contract was off 1.3 yen per kg at 146.8 yen.</p>
</text>
